# Template: entity_group. One DATA id over several tables, or a module's data
# diagram; lettered data diagrams use parts / part_of.
# Required: ready, kind, id, module, title, entities.
# Optional: summary, diagram {nodes, edges}, parts / part_of.
ready: 1
kind: entity_group
id: notes.data
module: notes
title: Notes data
entities:
  - notes.data.note
rationale: >-
  One table holds every note because notes have no structure beyond their
  text; owner_id on each row keeps every query scoped to one person.
